|YKB'An incapacitated enemy is of no consequence.'|WK0 - |RKBLord Sal Matis
|YK0
Stun is a Monk specific stat. It relates primarily to a Monks
ability to reduce a foes combat effectiveness. The greater the
stun ability of a Monk, the greater their ability to eliminate an
enemy. All Monks gain a rudimentary knowlege of this skill, but
it requires study to take full advantage of it. 
